export anchor Margin:
    description:
        Shorthand for the four margin sides: the space outside the component's border, separating it from its neighbours. One value sets all sides; two set top/bottom then left/right; three set top, left/right, bottom; four set top, right, bottom, left. Negative values are allowed.

    identifier: margin

    cssProperty:
        Corresponds to the CSS `margin` property.

    values:
        - `auto`
        - `<length>`
        - `<percentage>`
        - `<top> <right>? <bottom>? <left>?`

    initial: 0

    appliesTo: All components.

    example:
        ```emul
        \\\
        component Example:
            margin: 0 auto
        \\\
        ```
